### Enumeration and Deduplication Plan

- Ascending enumeration across page files, respecting documented gaps.
- Canonicalization rules: normalize Arabic names (strip diacritics; collapse whitespace), transliterate to Latin script, standardize dosage and strength, unify pack sizes, and map categories to controlled vocabulary.
- Stable indexing and slicing: assign a 1-based index to the deduplicated canonical list and slice at [1400:] to obtain products ≥1401.

