## Completion Roadmap to 880 Products

Scale plan. Execute batch URL discovery by class and market; prioritize fields in the sequence identification → commercial → clinical → safety → regulatory. Where leafets are referenced (Augmentin), capture minimal viable records and schedule targeted re-crawls. Apply a robust URL validation protocol: harvest slugs from listing titles, validate across eg-ar and sa-ar locales, corroborate with listing breadcrumbs, and retry failed fetches with exponential backoff.

